      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Need actual letters in a list.\n\nWalk all 26 jars. For each one, write its letter down as many times as it has pebbles.\n\n- jar e has 1 pebble → write e once\n- jar l has 2 pebbles → write l twice\n- jar b has 0 pebbles → write nothing",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Need actual letters in a list.\n\nWalk all 26 jars. For each one, write its letter down as many times as it has pebbles.\n\n- jar e has 1 pebble → write e once\n- jar l has 2 pebbles → write l twice\n- jar b has 0 pebbles → write nothing",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
